{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/e/38e3407c8266471ed91b7bc2197d09871186328c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = x^{2} + bx + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are integers. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is a factor of both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9e194d742a0138101ea2481e9ef01f677d937d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{4} + 6x^{2} + 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/0108bf4e098f7e5bebf68ab674387e64597a36d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^{4} + 4x^{2} + 28x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c5c9911c7798d30de896314c14dff1b969d179a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/5/415ff56a023256de6f614fad74f632fc814dd21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> must be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a907f3052204cb4e4d76596352f26f71afe514d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(x^4+6x^2+25)-(3x^4+4x^2+28x+5)=14x^2-28x+70=14(x^2-2x+5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"622\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bc60d593d169734a31a5d71f2cde38bb9a5fef5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)=x^2 -2x+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f62937ae49a319cdf3341e4051b94449eb63d23f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(1)=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2883cf9d91bf01d0e065d45a720482fd823f9dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(D) 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"51\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problem